# Minimum source revision for the 0.5 authenticated Redis gateway.
# rollout-compose.sh checks the image org.opencontainers.image.revision label
# and requires this revision to be an ancestor in the deploying checkout.
#
# This release snapshot includes applied credential receipts, exact-byte
# reload validation, retained-session revocation, reload heartbeat, joined
# shutdown, and the exec entrypoint handshake required by Manager.
# It also includes stage-birth and enforcing-lease prerequisites, and the
# entrypoint that keeps person grants (principals format 2, including
# restrict_unassigned) and configures the lazy, retained audit log, with
# every dir-stat and quota row under the person-grant check, no quota above
# the project depth while grants are in force, integer values only in the
# accounting hashes, and audit records bounded by encoded size. It also
# includes the guard fix (trash-root and hourly-create classification, the
# session and locked sets, the heartbeat gate, nextinode only as juicefs's
# recorded batch step, and recorded inode batches for new inodes). It also
# includes the Manager's removal of its own empty, recorded smart-folder
# views and the entrypoint that renders the smart-folder roots it runs.
#
# Bump after changes to internal/respproxy or server/respproxy/entrypoint.sh.
# TestH8BGateCoversEntrypointHandshake checks ancestry with full Git history.
# A squash or rebase requires a new pin to the resulting release-line commit.
